  "details": "Cant see any friends on the social tab for over 2 weeks now.\nWorld tab works fine other than viewing avatar author/world creator where it shows every world from the \"hot\" category as their creations.\n-Ive fully reinstalled the game\n-ive logged out and logged back in\n-ive cleared my cache\n-ive verified cache\n-i clicked expand un unexpand\n-ive tried turning the page\n-my firewall isint blocking anything\n-i am connected to the internet\n-ive disabled an re-enabled IPV6 DNS\n-ive downloaded cloudflare and tried that\n-i dont have any proxy settings\n-i meet the system requiremnts\n-my gpu and windows is fully updated\n-ive launched VRChat from the base folder\n-VRChat is whitelisted on my anti virus\nand ive restarted the game and ran it after every troubleshoot method, vrchat has provided to me.\n\n9/15/2022 ***UPDATE***\n-I've tried putting in launch options and they didnt work\n-i switched to BETA and the friends list didnt work in the beta as well",
